// The site map (plan du site): every page under home, pages hidden from the menu included, as
// nested lists of links, down to depth levels. With the main menu it gives visitors the second
// navigation system that RGAA 12.1 asks for. Built from the page tree like the menu: it stores no
// links, editors shape it by creating and ordering pages.
[ctpl:siteMap] > jnt:content, mix:title, ctplmix:pageComponent, ctplmix:sectionStyle
 - depth (long) = 5 autocreated < '[1,10]'
